N5008 [class.mi]/4: each A subobject is constructed by its own class's
constructor ([class.base.init]/13), copied and assigned separately by the
implicit copy constructor and copy assignment operator ([class.copy.ctor]/14,
[class.copy.assign]/12); a static member is one entity and is not ambiguous
([class.mi]/3 Note 3, [class.member.lookup]/5).  The front end rejected the
class.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only its
WRONG assertion.
